<title>JAPAN: Japan Dec platinum imports up 2.4 pct yr/yr--MOF.</title>
<headline>Japan Dec platinum imports up 2.4 pct yr/yr--MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's platinum imports in December were up 2.4 percent from a year earlier, Finance Ministry data released on Monday showed.</p>
<p>The figures were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		     Dec 96    Nov 96	Dec 95</p>
<p> Total		6.59	7.95	  6.43</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Russia	     2.10	3.53	  2.29</p>
<p> South Africa     2.69	2.83	  3.01</p>
<p>Total imports in 1996 were 72.02 tonnes, off slightly from 72.58 tonnes the year before.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3 3432 6179</p>
</text>
